  <!--EN: SoulBond-->
  <TM_SoulBond.label>灵魂契约</TM_SoulBond.label>
  <!--原中文: '恶魔或者那些拥有恶魔力量的人，可以与一个生物建立灵魂契约。灵魂契约将宿主灵魂的能量提供给恶魔，允许双向召唤。\n		\n灵魂契约可以通过重复使用取消。与另一个宿主建立灵魂契约将取消之前的契约。任一方死亡，契约也将终止。\n\n魅魔和术士形成了不同类型的灵魂契约——术士带来精神上的互惠，而魅魔则提高肉体的欢愉。一个宿主只能维持单一的灵魂契约（精神/肉体）', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Demons, or those possessing the power of a demon, can creates a soul bond (soul contract) with another pawn who will sustain (or host) the bond. The bond provides energy from the soul of the host to the demonkin, in exchange, the emotions of the host are washed away in bliss. The soul bond also creates a link that allows the demonkin to travel to, or summon, the host.
		
The soul bond contract may be canceled at any time by the demonkin by re-using the ability on the current host. Creating a soul bond with another host will cancel any previous contracts. The contract will also end if either party dies or is destroyed. 

Succubi and Warlocks form distinct types of soul bonds - warlocks bonds are mentally reciprocal while a succubus bonds are physical in nature. Demonkin can only sustain a single bond; hosts can only sustain a single bond of each type (mental/physical).',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Demons, or those possessing the power of a demon, can creates a soul bond (soul contract) with another pawn who will sustain (or host) the bond. The bond provides energy from the soul of the host to the demonkin, in exchange, the emotions of the host are washed away in bliss. The soul bond also creates a link that allows the demonkin to travel to, or summon, the host.
		
The soul bond contract may be canceled at any time by the demonkin by re-using the ability on the current host. Creating a soul bond with another host will cancel any previous contracts. The contract will also end if either party dies or is destroyed. 

Succubi and Warlocks form distinct types of soul bonds - warlocks bonds are mentally reciprocal while a succubus bonds are physical in nature. Demonkin can only sustain a single bond; hosts can only sustain a single bond of each type (mental/physical).-->
  <TM_SoulBond.description>恶魔或者那些拥有恶魔力量的人，可以与一个生物建立灵魂契约。灵魂契约将宿主灵魂的能量提供给恶魔，允许双向召唤。\n		\n灵魂契约可以通过重复使用取消。与另一个宿主建立灵魂契约将取消之前的契约。任一方死亡，契约也将终止。\n\n魅魔和术士形成了不同类型的灵魂契约——术士带来精神上的互惠，而魅魔则提高肉体的欢愉。一个宿主只能维持单一的灵魂契约（精神/肉体）</TM_SoulBond.description>
